{
  "declaredLength": 3288,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "어째서 우리가\n이런 곳에 있는 거죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11C0020C6B0B9ACAC00000AC774B7F00020ACF3C5D00020C788B2940020AC70C8E0003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 미르라는 곳 아니야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974B77CB2940020ACF30020C544B2C8C57C003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이렇게 말하고 있는 나도\n누군가의 잠재의식이 만들어 낸 존재겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B807AC8C0020B9D0D558ACE00020C788B2940020B098B3C4000AB204AD70AC00C7580020C7A0C7ACC758C2DDC7740020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B0B80020C874C7ACACA0C9C0003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "플레어단 누보의 두 사람!\n물어보고 싶은 게 있으니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n우리와 승부해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D50CB808C5B4B2E80020B204BCF4C7580020B4500020C0ACB78C0021000ABB3CC5B4BCF4ACE00020C2F6C7400020AC8C0020C788C73CB2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AC6B0B9ACC6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C918002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>도 협력해 줄 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000B3C40020D611B825D5740020C9040020AC70C9C0003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이죠!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C8E000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우선 상황을 파악하려는 거구나?\n알았어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C1200020C0C1D669C7440020D30CC545D558B824B2940020AC70AD6CB098003F000AC54CC558C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004> 함께라면\n반드시 이길 수 있을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000040020D568AED8B77CBA74000ABC18B4DCC2DC0020C774AE380020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C57C002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지가르데에게 선택받지 못한 분함이\n제 마음속에 아직 남아 있습니다...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이를 떨쳐 내기 위해서라도 승부해 주시죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AC00B974B370C5D0AC8C0020C120D0DDBC1BC9C00020BABBD55C0020BD84D568C774000AC81C0020B9C8C74CC18DC5D00020C544C9C10020B0A8C5440020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC774B97C0020B5A8CCD00020B0B4AE300020C704D574C11CB77CB3C40020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2DCC8E0002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부하는 건 상관없지만, 너희가 지면\n우리 가게에서 아르바이트를 해 줘야겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D558B2940020AC740020C0C1AD00C5C6C9C0B9CC002C0020B108D76CAC000020C9C0BA74000AC6B0B9AC0020AC00AC8CC5D0C11C0020C544B974BC14C774D2B8B97C0020D5740020C918C57CACA0C5B4002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이길 거예요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AE380020AC70C608C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸우고 싶지 않아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8C6B0ACE00020C2F6C9C00020C54AC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마음속의 불씨를 가만둬서는 안 됩니다!\n더욱 크게 타올라야만 합니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C74CC18DC7580020BD88C528B97C0020AC00B9CCB46CC11CB2940020C5480020B429B2C8B2E40021000AB354C6B10020D06CAC8C0020D0C0C62CB77CC57CB9CC0020D569B2C8B2E4002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리자몽! 흑염을 뿜어라!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACC790BABD00210020D751C5FCC7440020BFDCC5B4B77C002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 여긴 뭐 하러 온 거야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020C5ECAE340020BB500020D558B7EC0020C6280020AC70C57C002E002E002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불태워 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88D0DCC6CC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "플레어단에서 어떤 일을 했었는지\n아저씨에 대해 더 많이 알고 싶어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D50CB808C5B4B2E8C5D0C11C0020C5B4B5A40020C77CC7440020D588C5C8B294C9C0000AC544C800C528C5D00020B300D5740020B3540020B9CEC7740020C54CACE00020C2F6C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "눈부실 정도로 불태우기 위해\n메가진화로 타올라라! 리자몽!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B208BD80C2E40020C815B3C4B85C0020BD88D0DCC6B0AE300020C704D574000ABA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020D0C0C62CB77CB77C00210020B9ACC790BABD002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보로서 새롭게 살기 위해\n목숨을 불사르는 메가진화를 보여 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF4B85CC11C0020C0C8B86DAC8C0020C0B4AE300020C704D574000ABAA9C228C7440020BD88C0ACB974B2940020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리만이 아니라...\n아저씨들과의 유대도 보여 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACB9CCC7740020C544B2C8B77C002E002E002E000AC544C800C528B4E4ACFCC7580020C720B300B3C40020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부하기 전에 했던 약속, 기억하지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D558AE300020C804C5D00020D588B3580020C57DC18D002C0020AE30C5B5D558C9C0003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C785B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아저씨는... 크세로시키 아저씨는\n어째서 플레어단에서 활동을 했던 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C800C528B294002E002E002E0020D06CC138B85CC2DCD0A40020C544C800C528B294000AC5B4C9F8C11C0020D50CB808C5B4B2E8C5D0C11C0020D65CB3D9C7440020D588B3580020AC70C57C003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이 메가진화로 강해지는 것처럼\n인간을 강화할 방법을 연구하셨습니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그 결과물이 익스팬션슈트구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7740020BA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020AC15D574C9C0B2940020AC83CC98B7FC000AC778AC04C7440020AC15D654D5600020BC29BC95C7440020C5F0AD6CD558C168C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AADF80020ACB0ACFCBB3CC7740020C775C2A4D32CC158C288D2B8AD6CC694002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "원래는 저희가 피험자가 될 예정이었습니다.\n어째선지 당신으로 바뀌었지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6D0B798B2940020C800D76CAC000020D53CD5D8C790AC000020B4200020C608C815C774C5C8C2B5B2C8B2E4002E000AC5B4C9F8C120C9C00020B2F9C2E0C73CB85C0020BC14B00CC5C8C9C0B9CCC694002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아는 것은 그게 전부야.\n크세로시키 씨와는 관련된 적이 없거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2940020AC83C7400020ADF8AC8C0020C804BD80C57C002E000AD06CC138B85CC2DCD0A40020C528C640B2940020AD00B828B41C0020C801C7740020C5C6AC70B4E0002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아저씨는 나에게 상냥하게 대해 주셨으니까\n어떤 분인지 알고 싶었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C800C528B2940020B098C5D0AC8C0020C0C1B0E5D558AC8C0020B300D5740020C8FCC168C73CB2C8AE4C000AC5B4B5A40020BD84C778C9C00020C54CACE00020C2F6C5C8C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "연구가 최우선인 사람이었다고 생각합니다.\n하지만 피험자인 당신을 상냥하게 대했죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5F0AD6CAC000020CD5CC6B0C120C7780020C0ACB78CC774C5C8B2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D569B2C8B2E4002E000AD558C9C0B9CC0020D53CD5D8C790C7780020B2F9C2E0C7440020C0C1B0E5D558AC8C0020B300D588C8E0002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사람이란 모순된 일을 하기 마련이니까.\n너도 그렇게 생각하지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB78CC774B7800020BAA8C21CB41C0020C77CC7440020D558AE300020B9C8B828C774B2C8AE4C002E000AB108B3C40020ADF8B807AC8C0020C0DDAC01D558C9C0003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래도 추억은 변하지 않아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798B3C40020CD94C5B5C7400020BCC0D558C9C00020C54AC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상냥하게 대한 건 진심이었을 거예요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B0E5D558AC8C0020B300D55C0020AC740020C9C4C2ECC774C5C8C7440020AC70C608C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CC002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보답의 뜻으로 이것을 드리죠.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n덕분에 제가 지가르데에게\n선택받지 못한 이유를 깨달은 것 같습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4B2F5C7580020B73BC73CB85C0020C774AC83C7440020B4DCB9ACC8E0002E00100001BE01000AB355BD84C5D00020C81CAC000020C9C0AC00B974B370C5D0AC8C000AC120D0DDBC1BC9C00020BABBD55C0020C774C720B97C0020AE68B2ECC7400020AC830020AC19C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n그리 코디 쿡 코트 세트를 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000010000219000001000AADF8B9AC0020CF54B5140020CFE10020CF54D2B80020C138D2B8B97C0020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보 카페에서 아르바이트가 하고 싶으면\n그걸 입고 오라고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF40020CE74D398C5D0C11C0020C544B974BC14C774D2B8AC000020D558ACE00020C2F6C73CBA74000AADF8AC780020C785ACE00020C624B77CACE0002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 안 됩니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨는 도시의 포켓몬과 사람\n모두를 위해 일해야 하는 사람이니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
